2 CONT Saltykov, Sergei Sergeevich (25.III.1852+31.I.1896).  Educated in the Corps of Pages.  Promoted to the Chevalier Gardes Regiment (1872), Appointed Adjudant of Forces of Kharkov Military District (1881), Enscribed in Line Cavalry R
2 CONC eserve. His mother was a Bezobrazov, as was his wife.  The latter's father was the brother of his mother, so Saltykov was both uncle and first-cousin of the General Vladimir Mikhailovich Bezobrazov.
