2 CONC the-passing-of-dimitri-romanovich-romanoff.html link] > “Dimitri Romanovich Romanoff was born on May 17, 1926, in Antibes, France. He was the son of His Highness Prince of the Imperial Blood Roman Petrovich (1896-1978) and his mor
2 CONC ganatic wife, Countess Praskovia Dmitrievna Sheremeteva (1901-1980). With his death, the male line of morganatic descendants of the third son of Emperor Nicholas I, Grand Duke Nicholas Nikolaevich the Elder, becomes extinct. …”
