2 CONT '''2g) Fjodor (St.Petersburg 1 Nov 1875-Saint-Prix 22 Jul 1940); m.1st St.Petersburg 1898 (div?) Olga Khostschinsky (Woronesh 16 Jul 1878-Montreal 22 Apr 1952); m.2nd Dina Nikitovna Kirov
