2 CONT * https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Nikolai_Kasatkin-Rostovsky_%281%29
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Fyodor Nikolaevich Kasatkin-Rostov ( November 1  [13],  1875  - July 22, 1940 ) - Russian poet and publicist, author of the anthem of the Volunteer Army , colonel of the Semyonovsky Life Guards Regiment , participant in the
2 CONC  First World War and the Civil War.
2 CONT
