2 CONC and Nadezhda Fedorovna Poltoratskaia. He had the following siblings: 1) Princess Nadezhda Nikolaevna K-R (1873-1949) who married Nikolai Evgrafovich Mukhanov (1864-1933) 2) Prince Fedor Nikolaevich K-R (1875-1940) who m. 1stly Olg
2 CONC a Ermogenovna Khvoshchinskaia (1878-1952) and 2ndly Dina Nikitichna Kirova. 3) Princess Sofia Nikolaevna K-R (1877-1918) '''4) Princess Aleksandra Nikolaevna K-R (1885-1973) who married Anatolii Dmitrievich Vsevolozhskii (1870-192
2 CONC 7)''' 5) Prince Georgii Nikolaevich K-R (1897-?) According to the "Almanach de St-Petersbourg 1913/14" p. 294, Prince Nikolai Nikolaevich K-R was the President of the "Uprava" of the District of Novoskolsk, Government of Kursk.
