2 NOTE Hello!
3 CONT Dear Jean Henri Basile Pavloff!
3 CONT I collect materials and documents related to the Russian court costume, Russian court ladies, cavalier ladies of the order of St. Catherine and women's court insignia of the Russian Empire, as well as portraits and photographers.
3 CONT On the website Geni.com there is a picture of the Countess Evdokia Ivanovna Stenbok-Fermor (Comtesse Apraxine Evdokia Ivanovna), which is dependent in the ceremonial court costume of a lady-in-waiting of Empress Maria Alexandrovna
3 CONC . The counties has a monogram of Empress Maria Alexandrovna on her chest.
3 CONT The portrait of this lady is very rare and therefore interested me, as it relates to the subject of my research.
3 CONT Please tell me, if possible, where can I find this photo (publication in a book or article, in a Museum or archive, or in a private collection (in the archive of descendants)?
3 CONT I apologize if the text of the letter will be errors. Text through Google translate.
