1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Source: Wikipeida:
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas Romanovich Romanov, Prince of Russia also known as Prince Nicholas Romanov (Russian: Николай Романович Романов) (born 26 September 1922) is a claimant to the headship of the House of Romanov and President of the Romanov F
2 CONC amily Association. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Although he is undoubtedly a descendant of Tsar Nicholas I of Russia, his claimed titles and official membership in the former Imperial House are disputed by those who maintain that his parents' marriage violated the Laws of Imper
2 CONC ial Russia.
