2 CONT '''Anna Alexandrovna Vyrubova''', née Taneyeva (Russian: Анна Александровна Вырубова, Танеева) (16 July 1884 in Moscow — 20 July 1964, Helsinki), was a lady-in-waiting, best friend and confidante to Tsaritsa Alexandra Fyodorovna.
