1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stenbock~Fermor; Count Sergei Alekseevich (11.I.1873+31.I.1947).  Educated in the Imperial Alexander Lyceum (Class of 1894),  "Volunteer" in His Majesty's Hussar Guards Regiment (1894),  promoted to Cornet of His M
2 CONC ajesty's Hussar Regiment (1895),  left the Regiment to go to the Front (1904),  took part in the Russo~Japanese War (19041905),  returned to the Hussars (1906),  transferred to the Guards Cavalry Reserve (1907).  Left Russia after
2 CONC  the revolution and settled in Switzerland.
