1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Рубинштейн А.А., дочь Рубинштейна А.Г.
2 CONT Период создания:нач. 1880-х гг.
2 CONT
2 CONT Местонахождение
2 CONT Государственное автономное учреждение культуры Московской области "Государственный мемориальный музыкальный музей-заповедник П.И.Чайковского"https://goskatalog.ru/portal/#/museums?id=2010
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.tchaikovsky-research.net/pages/Anna_Rebezova
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Anton Rubinstein and his wife Vera (b. 1869; d. 1915), born Anna Antonovna Rubinshteyn (Анна Антоновна Рубинштейн); known during her first marriage as Anna Antonvna Rebezova (Анна Антоновна Ребезова) and after her seco
2 CONC nd marriage as Anna Antonovna Tilling (Анна Антоновна Тиллинг).
2 CONT
2 CONT Correspondence with Tchaikovsky
2 CONT 2 letters from Tchaikovsky to Anna Rebezova have survived, dating from 1890 and 1891, both of which have been translated into English on this website:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Letter 4103 – 3/15 May 1890, from Frolovskoye
2 CONT * Letter 4293a – 6/18 January 1891, from Frolovskoye
2 CONT 2 letters from Anna Rebezova to the composer, dating from 1890, are preserved in the Klin House-Museum Archive.
