2 CONT Bezobrazov, Georgi Vladimirovich (5.XII.1898+1.VI.1933).  Educated in the Corps of Pages but was never promoted, after running away to the front a number of times he was finally allowed to go to his cousin Ivan Orlov's Flying Deta
2 CONC chment as a "Volunteer" (XI.1916). After the revolution he was briefly imprisoned and on release left Russia for Denmark (1918). Died in the Belgian Congo.
